# Yerlesik oyuncunun yalitilmis sefer ve goruntu denetimi (ASCII).
# Komutlar: new lang mode select act week march petition save load panel scroll retreat accept
# expect remember same state wait settle shot quit. Son komut quit olmak zorundadir.
new
lang ru
wait 1
expect Week 0
expect Gold 840
expect Food 360
expect Language ru
shot 01-atlas-ru
scroll document 600
wait 0.3
shot 01b-council-lower-ru
scroll document 1200
wait 0.3
shot 01c-council-dumas-ru
scroll document 0
lang tr
wait 0.3
expect Language tr
shot 02-atlas-tr
scroll document 600
wait 0.3
shot 02b-council-lower-tr
scroll document 1200
wait 0.3
shot 02c-council-dumas-tr
scroll document 0
lang ru
act bread
expect Food 320
shot 03-bread-order
act tax
expect Gold 940
act recruit
expect Troops 1400
expect Gold 820
expect Food 300
panel economy
wait 0.3
shot 04-economy-ru
lang tr
wait 0.3
shot 05-economy-tr
panel council
select normandy
march
settle 5
expect ArmyRegionId normandy
expect Moves 1
expect Food 286
shot 06-march-arrived
mode unrest
wait 0.3
shot 07-map-unrest
mode tax
wait 0.3
shot 08-map-tax
mode army
wait 0.3
shot 09-map-army
mode food
wait 0.3
shot 09b-map-food
mode influence
wait 0.3
shot 09c-map-influence
mode control
week
expect Week 1
wait 0.5
panel journal
shot 10-week-journal
week
expect Week 2
expect PendingPetition True
wait 0.3
shot 11-petition-tr
lang ru
wait 0.3
shot 12-petition-ru
petition relief
expect PendingPetition False
state 13-petition-resolved
save
remember petition-save
select ile
load
same petition-save
shot 13-after-petition
new
panel council
select champagne
wait 0.3
shot 14-march-ready
march
wait 0.25
shot 14b-courier-dispatch
wait 2
expect BattleActive True
shot 15-battle-ru
wait 22
shot 16-volley
lang tr
wait 0.3
shot 17-battle-tr
retreat
wait 0.3
shot 18-report-tr
lang ru
wait 0.3
shot 19-report-ru
accept
settle 5
expect BattleActive False
expect ArmyRegionId ile
expect Moves 0
expect Food 342
state 20-battle-return
shot 20-return-atlas
save
remember battle-save
select normandy
load
same battle-save
expect ArmyRegionId ile
expect Food 342
state 21-loaded
quit
